<title>HONG KONG: Morning Star says to change name to MUI.</title>
<headline>Morning Star says to change name to MUI.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-12-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Travel services concern Morning Star Holdings Ltd said on Monday the company name would be changed to MUI Hong Kong Ltd with effect from Tuesday.</p>
<p>Earlier in December, the company said Firstway International Investment Ltd would hold about 60.9 percent of its enlarged share capital and 61 percent of the outstanding warrants on completion of a rights issue of 613.12 million new shares at HK$0.25 per rights share.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
